  "corrected_observations": [
    "The original six-map SO3 attempt passed only three maps; clock gaps around 0.62 s exceeded the former 0.5 s integration guard. Failed runs were not accepted.",
    "Chronological input replay and state-trace publication retain missed-interval motion instead of applying the latest command retroactively or connecting sparse endpoints.",
    "Substep auditing exposed a 3.932 m/s\u00b2 startup/feedback peak that post-plan finite-difference odometry missed. Total feedback plus feedforward is now constrained at the controller request.",
    "A force-only fix still reached 8.323 m/s\u00b2 in power plant and 3.349 m/s\u00b2 in duplex. Independent rotor clipping changed collective thrust under saturated torque; allocation now preserves collective and retains motor headroom.",
    "A tunnel run stalled at a wall-grazing route. Local A* and shortening now use the body-clearance predicate, with final spline and braking-volume checks retained.",
    "The 1.2 m/s\u00b2 total controller budget passed five maps but classical office reached 0.309 m tracking error during a run with a 0.642 s clock gap. The final 1.5 m/s\u00b2 request budget reserves feedback authority above the unchanged 1.2 m/s\u00b2 reference; all original gates remain in force.",
    "Force-budget changes alone did not fix long input gaps: duplex reached 0.874 m tracking error with a 0.833 s clock gap. Consistent received-reference prediction and a continuous watchdog stop replace the fixed old position/nonzero velocity combination. This failed attempt is not accepted as the final six-map baseline."
  ],
  "reproduction": {
    "environment": {
      "RMW_IMPLEMENTATION": "rmw_cyclonedds_cpp",
      "ROS_LOCALHOST_ONLY": "1",
      "CYCLONEDDS_URI": "<repository>/ros2_ws/src/falcon_so3_simulator/config/cyclone_loopback.xml"
    },
    "commands_from_repository_root_after_sourcing_ros_and_workspace": [
      "(cd ros2_ws && colcon test --event-handlers console_direct+ && colcon test-result --verbose)",
      "python3 ros2_ws/src/falcon_map_render/test/autonomous_regression.py --map all --duration 60 --execution-model so3 --output /tmp/falcon_so3_predictive_final",
      "ROS_DOMAIN_ID=229 python3 ros2_ws/src/falcon_fast_planner/test/initialization_tracking_regression.py --stop none --output /tmp/falcon_so3_predictive_startup",
      "ROS_DOMAIN_ID=229 python3 ros2_ws/src/falcon_fast_planner/test/initialization_tracking_regression.py --stop vertical --output /tmp/falcon_so3_predictive_startup",
      "ROS_DOMAIN_ID=229 python3 ros2_ws/src/falcon_fast_planner/test/initialization_tracking_regression.py --stop horizontal --output /tmp/falcon_so3_predictive_startup",
      "ROS_DOMAIN_ID=229 python3 ros2_ws/src/falcon_fast_planner/test/initialization_tracking_regression.py --stop none --delay-model-clock --output /tmp/falcon_so3_predictive_delay",
      "ROS_DOMAIN_ID=229 python3 ros2_ws/src/falcon_fast_planner/test/initialization_tracking_regression.py --stop none --delay-global-clock --output /tmp/falcon_so3_global_delay",
      "ROS_DOMAIN_ID=228 python3 ros2_ws/src/falcon_map_render/test/autonomous_regression.py --map darpa_tunnel --duration 60 --execution-model kinematic --output /tmp/falcon_kinematic_clearance"
    ]
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Each exploration run is bounded to 60 wall-clock seconds. FINISH or increased known task-box volume does not establish full reachable free-space coverage; solids and inaccessible volume remain in the denominator.",
    "Acceleration and speed peaks audit every integration substep, not every internal RK4 stage or continuous time. Source-geometry clearance uses actual state-trace samples at no more than 20 ms intervals.",
    "Tracking error compares sampled command and odometry positions only when timestamps differ by less than 50 ms. It is not a continuous tracking-error certificate.",
    "Clock catch-up preserves available received inputs. It does not reconstruct commands lost before receipt or replay earlier disturbance histories; arbitrary delay/disturbance robustness remains open.",
    "Validated presets, gains and trajectories only. Jerk/thrust/angular actuator guarantees, changed airframes, ground contact, calibrated drag and collision response remain unvalidated.",
    "Unknown centerline motion is rejected outside the trusted handoff body, but unknown surrounding body volume is not fully certified.",
    "Fast DDS endpoint discovery without user-data transport occurred on this WSL host; its root cause remains unproven. The opt-in Cyclone small-fragment profile is part of this reproduction baseline."
  ]
